    <h2>What This Blog Is (And Isn't)</h2>

    <p><strong>This blog is:</strong> Real stories from real trips. Budget travel that doesn't feel like suffering. The kind of places that change how you see the world. Honest opinions about what's worth your money and what isn't. The occasional bad trip, told truthfully.</p>

    <p><strong>This blog isn't:</strong> A series of sponsored posts where I pretend a resort is "authentic." A highlight reel. A listicle farm designed to rank on Google. Advice from someone who travels on a $500/day budget and calls it budget travel.</p>

    <h2>The Real Story</h2>

    <p>There's more to it than this. Why I started moving, what I was running toward (or away from), what travel actually does to your head when you do enough of it. That's a longer conversation.</p>

